      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ぼうず、よう集めて来てくれたのう！\nお前の親御さんが畑をやっとるのか？\nなに？　親は地下牢に入っとるじゃと！？\nならこの野菜、新鮮なうちに届けてやらんとな。",
        "official_en": "You did a great job gathering these! Your parents\nmust really appreciate all your help in the fields.\nThey're locked up? Ha! I almost believed you. I'm off\nto deliver these while they're still fresh. Thanks!",
